  "prefLabel": "Cub 301.12 Municipal assessing officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 301.12 “Municipal assessing officials” means those charged by law with the duty of assessing taxes, including the:\n\n(a) Governing body of a municipality;\n\n(b) Board of assessors or selectmen of a municipality; or\n\n(c) County commissioners of an unincorporated place.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cub100-300.html"
